From e2c653992c43891e1934834785be818cfd92261c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 02:58:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(power-supply): invalidate MCA authentication on UCSI
 connection events

Deliver physical UCSI connection changes synchronously through the power supply notifier instead of inferring attachment from sampled VBUS. Preserve every processed connection edge even when property notifications coalesce.

Bind authentication attempts, VDM writes and verified results to the attachment generation. Recheck after acquiring the transaction mutex and after replies. Reset old CP/HV policy on a new attachment while retaining authentication through ordinary PD voltage resets.
